# Dust spatial descriptions and terrain
breachpoint-area-t-spawn-description = A broad sunken courtyard where the Terrorists divide toward Long, Mid, or the tunnel approach.
breachpoint-area-outside-long-description = An exposed staging yard leading into the narrow Long Doors choke point.
breachpoint-area-long-doors-description = A tight stone gateway whose double doors conceal the open lane beyond.
breachpoint-area-pit-description = A recessed defensive pocket at the far end of Long with a commanding view toward Bombsite A.
breachpoint-area-a-long-description = A wide, exposed street climbing toward A Ramp and the elevated bombsite.
breachpoint-area-a-ramp-description = A sloped approach where attackers leave the Long street and commit to Bombsite A.
breachpoint-area-a-site-description = A high, open bombsite with strong crate positions and long approaches from Pit, Long, Short, and CT Spawn.
breachpoint-area-mid-description = The central crossroads linking T Spawn, Catwalk, Mid Doors, and Lower Tunnels.
breachpoint-area-catwalk-description = A raised side route from Mid toward the narrow A Short approach.
breachpoint-area-a-short-description = A compact elevated choke point overlooking the final approach to Bombsite A and CT Spawn.
breachpoint-area-mid-doors-description = A central double-door crossing that exposes a long view between T territory and CT Spawn.
breachpoint-area-ct-mid-description = The defender-side middle junction connecting Mid Doors, CT Spawn, and B Doors.
breachpoint-area-ct-spawn-description = The Counter-Terrorist rotation hub between both bombsites and the middle lanes.
breachpoint-area-outside-tunnels-description = A sheltered yard where Terrorists prepare before entering the tunnel system.
breachpoint-area-upper-tunnels-description = A broad enclosed chamber splitting toward B Tunnels and Lower Tunnels.
breachpoint-area-lower-tunnels-description = A narrow underground branch opening from the tunnels into Mid.
breachpoint-area-b-tunnels-description = A confined tunnel exit that commits attackers directly onto Bombsite B.
breachpoint-area-b-doors-description = The defender-side doorway linking CT Mid and CT Spawn to Bombsite B.
breachpoint-area-b-site-description = An enclosed bombsite with a raised platform, stacked crates, and opposing entries from Tunnels and B Doors.
